    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 76%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">OTC drugs for the treatment of common ailments, such as colds, headaches, stomach pain, cough, and eye strain, among others</span></td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="vertical-align: top"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Nutritional supplements</span></td>
