  <tr style="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="vertical-align: top"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Medical supplies and devices</span></td>
    <td style="vertical-align: bottom">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">A variety of general-purpose medical supplies and devices, such as bandages, masks, thermometers, disinfectant sprays, eye masks, contact lens, and contact lens cleaners and solutions</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We also currently have approximately 44,200 SKUs
