    Size<br/>
    (Square Feet)</b></span></td>
    <td style="width: 1%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 40%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Opened</b></span></td></tr>
