AND SUBSIDIARY</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; "><b>NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED
FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><div>

